{"id":"fb51163c70a06b3c","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-reflexive-interpretation.md","title":"Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Interpretations","display":"df-reflexive-interpretation — Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Interpretations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-reflexive-interpretation","aliases":["67-df-reflexive-interpretation"],"display":"df-reflexive-interpretation — Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Interpretations","depends_on":["[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","[[67-df-general-consistency]]","[[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]","[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_scope":"第 8 章 §1，Theorem 3 后定义，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"图像逐项核对；一般语言一致性内部算术化保留上游限制","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-reflexive-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-reflexive-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflexive-interpretation — Reflexive and Essentially Reflexive Interpretations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b666228ffebaa5c8\" href=\"?note=b666228ffebaa5c8\" title=\"67-df-interpretation-pullback\">67-df-interpretation-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 8 章 §1，Theorem 3 后定义，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"图像逐项核对；一般语言一致性内部算术化保留上游限制"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术句子公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\)</span> 是有限有效语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中的一致 PR 公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_K\">\\(t:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_K\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a>，是算术句，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 可以应用于它。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureExt}_K\">\\(\\mathrm{PureExt}_K\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b666228ffebaa5c8\" href=\"?note=b666228ffebaa5c8\" title=\"67-df-interpretation-pullback\">67-df-interpretation-pullback</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</li>\n<li>在本质反身性中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 遍历同一语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的一致 PR 公理呈示，采用同一标准语法编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_K\">\\(g_K\\)</span> 和证明演算；这些是第8章对理论的全局限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是固定解释数据，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 改变。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}\">\\(\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ERInt}_{K}\">\\(\\mathrm{ERInt}_{K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd^r_K\">\\(\\unlhd^r_K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd^{er}_K\">\\(\\unlhd^{er}_K\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_K\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_K\\)</span> 取一般一致性条目的外部谓词。</li>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_K\">\\(\\pi_K\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\\)</span>；本条所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\\)</span> 的 PA 内桥接条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}(S,T,t)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(S,T,t)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ERInt}_{K}(S,T,t)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\\n\\bigl[(\\mathrm{PureExt}_K(T,U)\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_K(U)\n\\land g_K[U]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}(S,U,t)\\bigr],\\\\\nS\\unlhd^r_K T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\ \\mathrm{RInt}_K(S,T,t),\\\\\nS\\unlhd^{er}_K T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\ \\mathrm{ERInt}_K(S,T,t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}(S,T,t)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(S,T,t)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ERInt}_{K}(S,T,t)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\\n\\bigl[(\\mathrm{PureExt}_K(T,U)\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_K(U)\n\\land g_K[U]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}(S,U,t)\\bigr],\\\\\nS\\unlhd^r_K T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\ \\mathrm{RInt}_K(S,T,t),\\\\\nS\\unlhd^{er}_K T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\ \\mathrm{ERInt}_K(S,T,t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>这是一条解释的性质，和算术公理集本身的 Reflexive 谓词不同：有限目标片段的一致性先写为算术句，再由同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 翻译。源语言限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 保证这个应用有类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\)</span> 沿用一般一致性条目所固定的 PR 特征函数关系类。</p>\n<p>原书印刷页120明确区分“每个纯扩张都有同一个解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的反身性”和“每个扩张存在某个解释”。新条目保留前一种量词次序。图像已核对上下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,er\">\\(r,er\\)</span> 以及一致性所截取的是目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 而非源 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 8 章 §1，Theorem 3 后定义，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：图像逐项核对；一般语言一致性内部算术化保留上游限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-general-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretation-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"b666228ffebaa5c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}$ 取 [[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}$ 取 [[67-df-general-consistency]]，是算术句，所以 $t$ 可以应用于它。$\\mathrm{PureExt}_K$ 取 [[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]，$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}$ 取 [[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}$ 取 [[67-df-general-consistency]]，是算术句，所以 $t$ 可以应用于它。$\\mathrm{PureExt}_K$ 取 [[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]，$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretation-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"b666228ffebaa5c8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}$ 取 [[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}$ 取 [[67-df-general-consistency]]，是算术句，所以 $t$ 可以应用于它。$\\mathrm{PureExt}_K$ 取 [[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]，$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}$ 取 [[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}$ 取 [[67-df-general-consistency]]，是算术句，所以 $t$ 可以应用于它。$\\mathrm{PureExt}_K$ 取 [[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]，$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-general-consistency]] 的同一个 $\\pi_K$，满足 $\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)$；本条所有 $K$-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 $\\mathrm{StdGPrf}$ 的 PA 内桥接条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureExt}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"g_K","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ERInt}_{K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd^r_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd^{er}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}(S,T,t)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}(S,T,t)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^K_{T\\upharpoonright_{g_K}k})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ERInt}_{K}(S,T,t)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\\n\\bigl[(\\mathrm{PureExt}_K(T,U)\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}_K(U)\n\\land g_K[U]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RInt}_{K}(S,U,t)\\bigr],\\\\\nS\\unlhd^r_K T&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\ \\mathrm{RInt}_K(S,T,t),\\\\\nS\\unlhd^{er}_K T&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\ \\mathrm{ERInt}_K(S,T,t).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"r,er","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":3869,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53f0a53ee4a6c70","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61b6be0b454e900c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r_K T$，$[T]^{<\\omega}$ 为 $T$ 的全部有限公理子集，取 [[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"a30b7d43cfef378b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r_K T$ 取 [[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]。右侧允许每个 $k$ 的解释数据不同；句法截断的是源公理，不是源理论的证明长度。"},{"id":"9648b1de11d1e866","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r_K T$ 取 [[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]。$[\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{<\\omega}$ 表示全部有限句子集合。有限公理化按与 $T$ 的全部句子定理等价定义，而非要求给定公理表本身有限。"},{"id":"d4e4a9a8f1949a67","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RInt}_K(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)$，$P=\\mathrm{PB}_{L_A,K}(t,T)$，取 [[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]、[[67-df-interpretation-pullback]]。$P$ 以定理闭句子集作为公理集，不假设该集合 PR。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]；[[../67-df-general-consistency]]；[[../67-df-interpretation-pullback]]；[[../67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]；[[../67-thm-general-second-incompleteness]]；[[../67-thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite]]；[[../67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek]]；[[../67-thm-reflexive-pullback-equivalence]]；[[../67-lem-general-orey-hajek]]；[[../67-thm-general-orey-compactness]]"}],"outgoing":["433a5a5e16d90414","a4af62d1c1b0b08f","b666228ffebaa5c8","55353aba49d6b3f2"]}